OL,3,GNEWSAPark cafe managers drop legal case
OL,4,Aover takeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple who run three independent
OL,7,Fcafes in north London parks have
OL,8,Fdropped their legal battle against a
OL,9,Fdecision that will see their cafe sites
OL,10,Fhanded over to a coffee chain.
OL,12,FHusband and wife Patrick Matthews and
OL,13,FEmma Fernandez have managed the sites
OL,14,Fat Queens Park, Parliament Hill Fields
OL,15,FLido, and Highgate Wood for nearly a
OL,16,Fdecade.
OL,18,FBut the City of London Corporation
OL,19,F(CLC) - which runs the parks - said it
OL,20,Fhad decided to hand the operating
OL,21,Fcontracts to restaurant chain Daisy
OL,22,FGreen instead.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
