OL,3,GNEWSAPark cafe managers drop legal case
OL,4,Aover takeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough they say a judge allowed a
OL,7,Flegal challenge of the decision, they
OL,8,Fhave decided not to pursue it, saying
OL,9,Fthe "personal and financial costs have
OL,10,Fbecome too great".
